  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 104130751}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8b9c0d1e2f3a4567890abcdef1234567, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textoEspanol: "El Protector de la Caravana comenzar\xE1 Nivel 2 y ser\xE1 de la
    clase elegida. Adem\xE1s tendr\xE1 el Rasgo \"Protector\" aumentando la VAL de
    aliados, pero restar\xE1 Esperanza si muere."
  textoIngles: "The Caravan Protector will start at Level 2 and belong to the selected
    class. They will also have the \u201CProtector\u201D Trait, increasing allies\u2019
    VAL, but reducing Hope if they die."
  textoPortugues: "O Protetor de Caravana come\xE7ar\xE1 no N\xEDvel 2 e pertencer\xE1
    \xE0 classe escolhida. Al\xE9m disso, ter\xE1 o Tra\xE7o \u201CProtetor\u201D,
    aumentando a VAL dos aliados, mas reduzindo a Esperan\xE7a caso morra."
  traducirTextoEspanol: 0
  manager: {fileID: 0}
