--- !u!114 &735199550
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 735199546}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a910377adbd87f4b8ff8436cb4f5107, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textoEspanol: "                                                                  
    <b>VERSI\xD3N DEMO</b>\r\n\r\n\nEsta demo incluye el tutorial y la regi\xF3n
    completa del <b><color=#D6A84B>Bosque Ardiente</color></b>.\r\n\r\nAunque la
    aventura est\xE1 limitada a esta regi\xF3n, <b>ninguna expedici\xF3n ser\xE1
    igual a la anterior</b>. Nuevos <color=#D6A84B>caminos, encuentros y personajes</color>
    pueden cambiar la experiencia completamente.\r\n\r\nLa versi\xF3n completa expandir\xE1
    el viaje con <b><color=#D6A84B>nuevas regiones, enemigos y desaf\xEDos</color></b>.\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#A0A0A0><i>Para
    poder mejorar el juego, durante la partida recolectamos informaci\xF3n sobre
    tu experiencia en tiempo real. Si quieres <b><color=#B8B8B8>desactivar la telemetr\xEDa</color></b>,
    puedes hacerlo sin problemas ahora.</i></color>"
  textoIngles: "                                                                  
    <b>DEMO VERSION</b>\r\n\r\n\r\nThis demo includes the tutorial and the complete
    <b><color=#D6A84B>Burning Forest</color></b> region.\r\n\r\nAlthough the adventure
    is limited to this region, <b>no two expeditions will be exactly the same</b>.
    New <color=#D6A84B>paths, encounters, and characters</color> can completely change
    the experience.\r\n\r\nThe full version will expand the journey with <b><color=#D6A84B>new
    regions, enemies, and challenges</color></b>.\r\n\r\n\n\n\r<color=#A0A0A0><i>To
    help us improve the game, we collect information about your experience in real
    time during gameplay. If you wish to <b><color=#B8B8B8>disable telemetry</color></b>,
    you can do so now.</i></color>"
  textoPortugues: "                                                                  
    <b>VERS\xC3O DEMO</b>\r\n\r\n\r\nEsta demo inclui o tutorial e a regi\xE3o completa
    da <b><color=#D6A84B>Floresta Ardente</color></b>.\r\n\r\nEmbora a aventura esteja
    limitada a esta regi\xE3o, <b>nenhuma expedi\xE7\xE3o ser\xE1 exatamente igual
    \xE0 anterior</b>. Novos <color=#D6A84B>caminhos, encontros e personagens</color>
    podem mudar completamente a experi\xEAncia.\r\n\r\nA vers\xE3o completa expandir\xE1
    a jornada com <b><color=#D6A84B>novas regi\xF5es, inimigos e desafios</color></b>.\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#A0A0A0><i>Para
    nos ajudar a melhorar o jogo, coletamos informa\xE7\xF5es sobre a sua experi\xEAncia
    em tempo real durante a partida. Se quiser <b><color=#B8B8B8>desativar a telemetria</color></b>,
    voc\xEA pode fazer isso agora sem nenhum problema.</i></color>"
